WEBVTT

00:00:00.102 --> 00:00:03.877
When AND OR and NOT appear together SQL follows an
order of

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:09.601
operations NOT is evaluated first then AND and then
OR

00:00:10.517 --> 00:00:14.344
This is similar to the idea of order of operations
in mathematics

00:00:15.246 --> 00:00:18.365
The problem is that a query can be technically
correct but still

00:00:18.378 --> 00:00:22.618
be difficult for another person to read That is why
I recommend

00:00:22.643 --> 00:00:25.955
using parentheses whenever AND and OR are mixed in
the same rule

00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:32.051
Parentheses are not only for the database They are
also documentation for

00:00:32.076 --> 00:00:36.200
you and for anyone else reading the query later If
your business

00:00:36.226 --> 00:00:40.633
rule says that two conditions belong together show
that relationship explicitly with

00:00:40.646 --> 00:00:41.535
parentheses
